# Supabase Realtime Configuration for color-fool
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In your Supabase Dashboard, go to Project Settings -> API
# 3. Copy your Project URL and anon public key here:

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
# Optional EAS Build CLI commands:
# npx eas-cli env:set --environment preview production --name EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL --value "https://your-project.supabase.co" --type string --visibility plaintext
# npx eas-cli env:set --environment preview production --name EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY --value "your-anon-key" --type string --visibility plaintext